{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "ead9d03d25434288", "id": "ead9d03d25434288", "url": "https://platform.deepseek.com/", "url_canon": "https://platform.deepseek.com/", "title": "DeepSeek API明确节假日及调休周末全天按空闲时段计费", "content_text": "**DeepSeek** `API`平台近日发布公告横幅明确，调休上班的周末和中国法定节假日全天按空闲时段计费。该规则面向使用**DeepSeek**官方`API`的用户。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["dev-eco", "confirmed"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "e49df2e8f3181f6d", "id": "e49df2e8f3181f6d", "url": "https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2101352781219258527", "url_canon": "https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2101352781219258527", "title": "Tibo疑似暗示Codex banked reset", "content_text": "有用户因 **OpenAI** 本周没有推出预期更新，向 **Codex** 负责人 **Tibo** 索要 `banked reset`，**Tibo** 回复：“OK fine. But it’s also still coming in **Tuesday**”。 有人认为“OK fine”是在同意提供 `banked reset`；也有观点认为他并未确认 `reset`，真正明确的只是此前预告的内容仍会在**周二**到来。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["dev-eco", "reported"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "ba7844c57c1724ca", "id": "ba7844c57c1724ca", "url": "https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/step-5", "url_canon": "https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/step-5", "title": "Step 5 Preview现身Artificial Analysis网站", "content_text": "阶跃星辰的 Step 5 Preview模型现身Artificial Analysis榜单，另有部分Step Plan用户称已可调用。第三方评测显示，该模型智能指数为44，支持1M上下文和视觉输入。更多信息有待官方正式发布。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["model-release", "reported"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "8718fa8cc42ad61b", "id": "8718fa8cc42ad61b", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Rc3CKdHAtA_NdVRN2RLuAg", "url_canon": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Rc3CKdHAtA_NdVRN2RLuAg", "title": "千问发布Qwen3.8-LiveTranslate", "content_text": "**千问**发布同传模型`Qwen3.8-LiveTranslate`，支持**60种语言**实时翻译。模型采用`Interleave`架构和`Thinker-Talker`双模块设计，新增`实时说话人分离`、`原文译文同帧输出`与`长上下文消歧`能力，在线体验与`API`均已上线。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["model-release", "confirmed"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "49d1e4e1e5ef71fa", "id": "49d1e4e1e5ef71fa", "url": "https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/damo-radar", "url_canon": "https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/damo-radar", "title": "阿里巴巴达摩院开源腹部CT诊断模型RADAR，论文发表于Science", "content_text": "**阿里巴巴达摩院**开源了腹部`CT`诊断`视觉语言模型``RADAR`，论文发表于Science。该模型用**超40万例**CT和**1500万**图文对训练，覆盖**18个**解剖结构和**146项**影像发现，内外部诊断`AUC` **超0.87**。代码与权重已开放。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["model-release", "confirmed"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "721c94bd6f2f3edc", "id": "721c94bd6f2f3edc", "url": "https://huggingface.co/cua-ai/cua-s1-forms", "url_canon": "https://huggingface.co/cua-ai/cua-s1-forms", "title": "Cua开源小型表单填写模型cua-s1-forms", "content_text": "**Cua**开源约**70万**参数的表单填写模型`cua-s1-forms`，可并行判断表单元素该填写、勾选、点击还是跳过，代码和权重均已开放，支持本地运行。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["model-release", "confirmed"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "f1b9b8b4f2d59e73", "id": "f1b9b8b4f2d59e73", "url": "https://github.com/XingChen-AGI/Xing4.0-29B-A4B", "url_canon": "https://github.com/XingChen-AGI/Xing4.0-29B-A4B", "title": "中国电信开源Xing4.0-29B-A4B模型", "content_text": "**中国电信**近期开源了星辰语义大模型`Xing4.0-29B-A4B`，总参数量**29B**，激活参数**4B**。该模型面向复杂工程与`Agent`任务优化，完全基于国产算力训练。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["model-release", "confirmed"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "8a37e6139f628811", "id": "8a37e6139f628811", "url": "https://x.com/AndroidDev/status/2100622197253398669", "url_canon": "https://x.com/AndroidDev/status/2100622197253398669", "title": "Android Developers推出Android Bench 2.0", "content_text": "`Android Bench 2.0`现已推出，将`AI`评测扩展到真实多日`Android`工程任务，并开始评估`Agent`与模型组合，相关结果已可查看。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["tech-insight", "confirmed"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "8256e22ea7196985", "id": "8256e22ea7196985", "url": "https://news.bloomberglaw.com/litigation/openai-anthropic-google-spacexai-hit-with-antitrust-lawsuit", "url_canon": "https://news.bloomberglaw.com/litigation/openai-anthropic-google-spacexai-hit-with-antitrust-lawsuit", "title": "OpenAI等四家公司遭付费用户提起反垄断诉讼", "content_text": "一批付费用户在加州联邦法院起诉**OpenAI**、**Anthropic**、**SpaceXAI**和**Google**，指控四家公司高管公开呼吁协调限制`AI`进步速度，违反`反垄断法`。原告称这种合谋导致用户以原价获得改进更慢的产品，正寻求`集体诉讼认证`及`禁令`，**四家公司**尚未回应。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["industry", "reported"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "63b48040f2bb54c4", "id": "63b48040f2bb54c4", "url": "https://www.reuters.com/business/anthropic-considers-releasing-new-ai-model-ahead-ipo-sources-say-2026-09-19/", "url_canon": "https://reuters.com/business/anthropic-considers-releasing-new-ai-model-ahead-ipo-sources-say-2026-09-19", "title": "Anthropic 或将发布发布新模型应对Astra在企业市场的竞争", "content_text": "据报道，**Anthropic**正考虑发布新模型应对**Astra**在企业市场的竞争，安全评估仍在进行。另有爆料博主称新版`Fable`、`Opus`和`Sonnet`正在部分账号隐蔽测试，但相关信息尚无官方确认。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["rumor-mill", "reported"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "442871e785926b1c", "id": "442871e785926b1c", "url": "https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2101157729037586694", "url_canon": "https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2101157729037586694", "title": "OpenAI 或将发布 GPT-6 Sol 和 GPT-6 Luna", "content_text": "**OpenAI** 或将在下周推出新的 `GPT-6` 系列模型。**Sam Altman** 此前表示，原计划发布、自己最期待的内容已推迟到下周；**OpenAI** 团队成员 **Tibo** 近期称，下周会先发布“一些东西”，目前准备中的新内容甚至“可能够办 **3** 个 `DevDay`”。 当用户直接提出想要 `GPT-6 Sol` 和 `GPT-6 Luna` 时，**Tibo** 回复“What else do you want”，使这两款模型成为当前主要猜测对象。 不过，**OpenAI** 目前尚未正式透露相关信息，**OpenAI** `DevDay` 将于当地时间 **9 月 29 日** 举行。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["rumor-mill", "rumor"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "c90c60220665332a", "id": "c90c60220665332a", "url": "https://x.com/god_of_ai7/status/2101237972633063922", "url_canon": "https://x.com/god_of_ai7/status/2101237972633063922", "title": "Google 或将发布 Gemini 4 Pro", "content_text": "近期多名用户称，**Arena** 中的 `gemini-3.8-flash` 会随机路由至疑似 **Gemini 4 Pro** 的 `Argon` checkpoint，**SVG**、**3D** 场景、网页和游戏生成表现优异；另有一张已被鉴定为使用 `GPT-Image` 生成的基准测试图流传。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["rumor-mill", "rumor"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "36dfd88d234122fd", "id": "36dfd88d234122fd", "url": "https://github.com/search?q=repo%3AMiniMax-AI%2Fminimax-code+minimax-m3.1&type=code", "url_canon": "https://github.com/search?q=repo%3AMiniMax-AI%2Fminimax-code+minimax-m3.1&type=code", "title": "MiniMax 或将发布 MiniMax-M3.1", "content_text": "**MiniMax**官方近期开源的`CLI`工具的代码中，多个文件出现了`MiniMax-M3.1`标识，配有多套`上下文`与`输出参数`及`thinking effort`档位。另有一张社区流传的截图显示官方工作人员预告该模型即将发布。目前未有更多的官方信息。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["rumor-mill", "rumor"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
{"schema": "raw_item/1", "item_key": "cbf2e385752a521d", "id": "cbf2e385752a521d", "url": "https://no-source.local/kimi", "url_canon": "https://no-source.local/kimi", "title": "月之暗面或将发布 Kimi K3.1", "content_text": "**Kimi**知乎认证机构号发布了一串省略开头**3.1**的圆周率数字，这被解读为暗示**Kimi** `K3.1`即将发布。不过帖文并未直接提及`K3.1`，目前该动态已被删除。", "date_published": "2026-09-20T08:00:00+08:00", "date_fetched": "2026-09-20T09:12:31+08:00", "language": "zh", "tags": ["rumor-mill", "rumor"], "_source": {"name": "daily-pool", "feed_url": "multi", "kind": "rss", "item_guid": null}, "_fetch": {"status": 200, "via": "direct", "reachable": true, "etag": null, "content_sha256": null}}
